      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.69,
          "en": "By now we get a pretty good understanding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.69,
          "end": 9.24,
          "en": "about how Vue helps us with animating things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 12.2,
          "en": "There's one specific kind of thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.2,
          "end": 13.42,
          "en": "which you might want to navigate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.42,
          "end": 15.71,
          "en": "which we haven't seen thus far though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.71,
          "end": 19.89,
          "en": "And that would be changes between two routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.89,
          "end": 23.38,
          "en": "For that, I'll quickly add routing here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.38,
          "end": 25.95,
          "en": "simply by adding a new pages folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.95,
          "end": 30.95,
          "en": "And then in here we could have AllUsers page, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.69,
          "end": 34.21,
          "en": "and also a CourseGoals page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.21,
          "end": 38.37,
          "en": "I will not really populate those components with life",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.37,
          "end": 39.81,
          "en": "or with real values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.81,
          "end": 42.86,
          "en": "I just want to dive into how we can animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.86,
          "end": 44.92,
          "en": "between these pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.92,
          "end": 47.45,
          "en": "For that, here I'll simply add a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.45,
          "end": 52.45,
          "en": "with a class of container in the template off AllUsers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.87,
          "end": 57.083,
          "en": "And add a h2 tag where I say All Users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.95,
          "end": 61.33,
          "en": "And I'll then copy that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.33,
          "end": 63.58,
          "en": "and add the same here to CourseGoals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.58,
          "end": 66.13,
          "en": "but of course here I will say CourseGoals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.13,
          "end": 69.37,
          "en": "so that we can tell these two pages apart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.37,
          "end": 71.5,
          "en": "So these are very simple dummy components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.5,
          "end": 73.8,
          "en": "which just have templates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.8,
          "end": 77.3,
          "en": "Now we can quit the development server with Control + C,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.3,
          "end": 82.3,
          "en": "and npm install, dash, dash, save the vue-router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.43,
          "end": 84.74,
          "en": "This package, which we already installed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.74,
          "end": 86.293,
          "en": "in the routing module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.61,
          "end": 90.65,
          "en": "Once it is installed, we can restart the development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.65,
          "end": 93.22,
          "en": "and then add routing as you learned it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.22,
          "end": 94.77000000000001,
          "en": "in the routing module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.77000000000001,
          "end": 99.25,
          "en": "So here in main.js or in a separate router.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.25,
          "end": 102.84,
          "en": "But since we'll only have two routes, I'll go with main.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.84,
          "end": 107.84,
          "en": "You can import createRouter from vue-router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.93,
          "end": 111.36699999999999,
          "en": "and also already import createWebHistory",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.12,
          "end": 115.61,
          "en": "and then set up the router here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.61,
          "end": 119.78999999999999,
          "en": "So here we have the router we created with createRouter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.78999999999999,
          "end": 122.313,
          "en": "and pass a config object to createRouter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.15,
          "end": 125.953,
          "en": "Set the history two to result of createWebHistory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.54,
          "end": 131.2,
          "en": "And then add our routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.2,
          "end": 133.73,
          "en": "And I gonna have two routes here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.73,
          "end": 138.73,
          "en": "The first route should be applied if we have slash, nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139,
          "end": 144,
          "en": "In this case, I want to load the AllUsers component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 144.63,
          "end": 146.861,
          "en": "Therefore, we should import it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.861,
          "end": 151.861,
          "en": "AllUsers from dot, slash, pages/AllUsers.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.03,
          "end": 155.01,
          "en": "And we can also already import CourseGoals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.01,
          "end": 159.673,
          "en": "from dot, slash, pages/CourseGoals.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 160.95,
          "end": 165.11,
          "en": "Then load AllUsers here on this first route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 165.11,
          "end": 166.97,
          "en": "And then add a second route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 166.97,
          "end": 170.42000000000002,
          "en": "with a path of slash, goals, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 170.42000000000002,
          "end": 174.523,
          "en": "where we want to load the CourseGoals component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 175.55,
          "end": 178.2,
          "en": "So these are the two routes I have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 178.2,
          "end": 181.99,
          "en": "Now we can call app.use to register this router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 181.99,
          "end": 183.38,
          "en": "with our Vue app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 183.38,
          "end": 186.533,
          "en": "And with that, Vue is aware of these routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 187.72,
          "end": 190.04,
          "en": "Now, as you learned that in order to load a route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 190.04,
          "end": 193.76,
          "en": "and to display it, we need to go to our App.vue file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 193.76,
          "end": 197.54,
          "en": "and in there I will actually remove all the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 197.54,
          "end": 201.55,
          "en": "we had in there and just add router-view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 201.55,
          "end": 205.32,
          "en": "so that we just switched between these two components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.32,
          "end": 207.97,
          "en": "based on which route we selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 207.97,
          "end": 212.35,
          "en": "In order to move back and forth between these components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 212.35,
          "end": 214.36,
          "en": "from inside the running app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.36,
          "end": 217.91,
          "en": "I will actually also go to AllUsers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.91,
          "end": 222.323,
          "en": "and add a router link to my CourseGoals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 223.78,
          "end": 228.04,
          "en": "So therefore, the two prop points at slash, goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 228.04,
          "end": 231.773,
          "en": "because that was the path I'm handling here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 233.26,
          "end": 234.92000000000002,
          "en": "And I will copy that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 234.92000000000002,
          "end": 237.55,
          "en": "And in CourseGoals I'll add the same link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 237.55,
          "end": 239.75,
          "en": "but I'll go to just slash here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 239.75,
          "end": 241.853,
          "en": "which therefore goes to AllUsers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 243.89,
          "end": 248.34,
          "en": "If we save that, I got some complaints here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 248.34,
          "end": 249.3,
          "en": "that I'm not using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 249.3,
          "end": 252.2,
          "en": "the users list component anymore in App.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 252.2,
          "end": 254.34,
          "en": "And that's correct, I'm registering it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 254.34,
          "end": 257.1,
          "en": "but I'm not doing anything with it in my template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 257.1,
          "end": 260.42,
          "en": "So we can comment this out and remove this import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 260.42,
          "end": 263.86,
          "en": "or remove the components option entirely here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 263.86,
          "end": 267.32,
          "en": "And now with that saved, we see All Users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 267.32,
          "end": 270.52,
          "en": "and we can switch between those routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 270.52,
          "end": 274.573,
          "en": "That's all nice, but it has nothing to do with animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 275.49,
          "end": 278.65,
          "en": "Well, I want to animate the transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 278.65,
          "end": 280.82,
          "en": "between these two routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 280.82,
          "end": 283.65999999999997,
          "en": "And thankfully we can do this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 283.65999999999997,
          "end": 286.74,
          "en": "Now, one thought you could have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 286.74,
          "end": 291.74,
          "en": "is that you wrap your router-view with transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 292.6,
          "end": 294.72,
          "en": "I mean, it's a regular component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.72,
          "end": 297.76,
          "en": "And if we want to animate with Vue's help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 297.76,
          "end": 301.71,
          "en": "between two components, like the button we saw earlier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 301.71,
          "end": 304.73,
          "en": "then we wrap the element with transition, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 304.73,
          "end": 307.21,
          "en": "That's what we did previously in this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 307.21,
          "end": 309.363,
          "en": "when we wanted to animate components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 310.58,
          "end": 314.88,
          "en": "And we could then defines a new CSS classes here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 314.88,
          "end": 317.903,
          "en": "Route-enter-from.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 320.05,
          "end": 323.86,
          "en": "Route-enter-active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 323.86,
          "end": 326.69,
          "en": "And route-enter-to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 326.69,
          "end": 328.27,
          "en": "And I want to use that animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 328.27,
          "end": 331.55,
          "en": "so I will actually only use route-enter-active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 331.55,
          "end": 334.98,
          "en": "and use my slide scale animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 334.98,
          "end": 337.07,
          "en": "the key frames which are set here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 337.07,
          "end": 342.07,
          "en": "over .4 seconds and with an ease function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 342.58,
          "end": 344.9,
          "en": "or ease out, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 344.9,
          "end": 349.35,
          "en": "And then also define route-leave-active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 349.35,
          "end": 352.52,
          "en": "Of course, depending on which animation you want to build,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 352.52,
          "end": 356.43,
          "en": "you could also add route-leave-from and route-leave-to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 356.43,
          "end": 359.39,
          "en": "But here I again, just want to apply an animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 359.39,
          "end": 361.54,
          "en": "And that will be a slide scale",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 361.54,
          "end": 363.833,
          "en": "over the same duration with ease in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 365.11,
          "end": 368.61,
          "en": "And now, since I named these CSS classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 368.61,
          "end": 370.86,
          "en": "like this with route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 370.86,
          "end": 375.86,
          "en": "we could apply this name to this transition like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 376.42,
          "end": 379.46,
          "en": "But since I always say could, and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 379.46,
          "end": 383,
          "en": "this probably is not how it's going to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 383,
          "end": 387.3,
          "en": "And indeed, we do have some strange behavior here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 387.3,
          "end": 391.54,
          "en": "but we actually see that router-view can no longer be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 391.54,
          "end": 394.18,
          "en": "directly inside of transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 394.18,
          "end": 395.90999999999997,
          "en": "Now, it says no longer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 395.90999999999997,
          "end": 398.93,
          "en": "because previously with older versions of Vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 398.93,
          "end": 400.14,
          "en": "that did work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 400.14,
          "end": 401.61,
          "en": "So maybe if you learned that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 401.61,
          "end": 404.033,
          "en": "you are still used to this old way of doing it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 404.93,
          "end": 408.37,
          "en": "With Vue 3 this is no longer possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 408.37,
          "end": 410.07,
          "en": "And we actually get the solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 410.07,
          "end": 411.81,
          "en": "here in the warning as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 411.81,
          "end": 414.64,
          "en": "We need to restructure our code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 414.64,
          "end": 419.64,
          "en": "Transition now needs to go inside of our router-view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 419.81,
          "end": 422.633,
          "en": "So we should move transition inside there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 423.67,
          "end": 425.87,
          "en": "But this alone now all the won't do it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 425.87,
          "end": 429.5,
          "en": "because while router-view supports getting content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 429.5,
          "end": 431.34,
          "en": "that will be rendered inside of it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 431.34,
          "end": 434.14,
          "en": "now we also need to tell it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 434.14,
          "end": 437.51,
          "en": "where to actually render the actual page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 437.51,
          "end": 439.92,
          "en": "the actual component that should be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 439.92,
          "end": 441.983,
          "en": "based on the route that is active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 442.83,
          "end": 445.87,
          "en": "And for that, we can use the scoped slots syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 445.87,
          "end": 448.35,
          "en": "router-view uses under the hood.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 448.35,
          "end": 450.13,
          "en": "Normally we don't need it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 450.13,
          "end": 453.46,
          "en": "but for transitions with routes, you do need it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 453.46,
          "end": 455.76,
          "en": "You can use this v-slot directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 455.76,
          "end": 457.86,
          "en": "which I introduced earlier in the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 457.86,
          "end": 460.12,
          "en": "when we talked about slots,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 460.12,
          "end": 464.413,
          "en": "to extract the slotProps you're getting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 465.26,
          "end": 468.15999999999997,
          "en": "You get those by the router-view component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 468.15999999999997,
          "end": 469.97,
          "en": "which is built in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 469.97,
          "end": 474.11,
          "en": "And you can then use the dynamic component component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 474.11,
          "end": 476.97,
          "en": "to bind it to slotProps.Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 481.6,
          "end": 485.46,
          "en": "So slotProps have a property named Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 485.46,
          "end": 488.64,
          "en": "with a capital C, which holds the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 488.64,
          "end": 492.68,
          "en": "that should be loaded for the currently selected route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 492.68,
          "end": 495.7,
          "en": "And this strange looking syntax is what you need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 495.7,
          "end": 499.423,
          "en": "to animate switches between these components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 500.67,
          "end": 504.34,
          "en": "If you now save this, you no longer get the warning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 504.34,
          "end": 506.39,
          "en": "And now this kind of works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 506.39,
          "end": 509.22,
          "en": "but of course this looks really stupid here, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 509.22,
          "end": 510.93,
          "en": "I mean, it's just moving around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 510.93,
          "end": 515.93,
          "en": "and we got two components on the page at the same time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 516.09,
          "end": 518.41,
          "en": "So this is not fully what we want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 518.41,
          "end": 521.05,
          "en": "but technically this is correct at least.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 521.05,
          "end": 522.9,
          "en": "But one thing we want to change here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 522.9,
          "end": 525.15,
          "en": "is something we already saw earlier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 525.15,
          "end": 527.29,
          "en": "when we switched between two buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 527.29,
          "end": 529.52,
          "en": "We want to make sure that only one component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 529.52,
          "end": 532.9,
          "en": "is shown on the page at the same time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 532.9,
          "end": 535.39,
          "en": "And you might remember that we can achieve this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 535.39,
          "end": 539.08,
          "en": "by adding the mode prop to the transition component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 539.08,
          "end": 543.21,
          "en": "And there we add out-in and in-out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 543.21,
          "end": 546.23,
          "en": "And if we use out-in, we ensure that first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 546.23,
          "end": 548.63,
          "en": "the leaving component is animated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 548.63,
          "end": 553.2,
          "en": "before then the entering component is animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 553.2,
          "end": 555.4,
          "en": "So with that, if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 555.4,
          "end": 559.16,
          "en": "now this leaves and then we have the new component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 559.16,
          "end": 561.96,
          "en": "I will admit it still looks strange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 561.96,
          "end": 565.903,
          "en": "but that's just because of the animation CSS code we set up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 567.67,
          "end": 569.3,
          "en": "If we use a different animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 569.3,
          "end": 572.38,
          "en": "like the fade button classes we have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 572.38,
          "end": 576.25,
          "en": "if I use this as a name here, fade button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 576.25,
          "end": 577.613,
          "en": "this will look nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 578.64,
          "end": 581.38,
          "en": "With that we've got a nice fade animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 581.38,
          "end": 582.623,
          "en": "between these routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 583.75,
          "end": 587.94,
          "en": "So that is how you can animate route transitions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 587.94,
          "end": 590.5,
          "en": "Now, one thing you might have noticed before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 590.5,
          "end": 593.73,
          "en": "is that when you used that other animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 593.73,
          "end": 597.5,
          "en": "which looked a bit strange, the route animation here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 597.5,
          "end": 601.14,
          "en": "we even saw that animation when we loaded the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 601.14,
          "end": 603.46,
          "en": "for the first time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 603.46,
          "end": 606.31,
          "en": "So you have this initial animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 606.31,
          "end": 609.27,
          "en": "The reason for data's that with the vue-router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 609.27,
          "end": 613.39,
          "en": "technically the first act of route is an empty route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 613.39,
          "end": 615.5,
          "en": "And then when your page starts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 615.5,
          "end": 617.82,
          "en": "when your page is loaded for the first time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 617.82,
          "end": 621.26,
          "en": "it immediately switches to the route that should be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 621.26,
          "end": 623.053,
          "en": "for the given path in your URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 624.33,
          "end": 627.48,
          "en": "That means that technically when the app starts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 627.48,
          "end": 629.97,
          "en": "the vue-router goes from no route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 629.97,
          "end": 633.87,
          "en": "to the chosen route for to given path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 633.87,
          "end": 635.98,
          "en": "And hence it plays an animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 635.98,
          "end": 639,
          "en": "because we go from one component, nothing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 639,
          "end": 640.943,
          "en": "to the to be loaded component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 641.95,
          "end": 646.19,
          "en": "To avoid this behavior, you can go to main.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 646.19,
          "end": 648.38,
          "en": "where you register the router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 648.38,
          "end": 652.1,
          "en": "and there you can actually use the router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 652.1,
          "end": 655.18,
          "en": "to call the is ready method on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 655.18,
          "end": 657.3,
          "en": "This method will let you know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 657.3,
          "end": 660.93,
          "en": "when the router successfully evaluated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 660.93,
          "end": 662.753,
          "en": "which page should be loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 664.25,
          "end": 668.21,
          "en": "This gives you a promise and hence you can call then on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 668.21,
          "end": 671.33,
          "en": "And in the function you pass to this then block,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 671.33,
          "end": 674.95,
          "en": "in this function the router will now not go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 674.95,
          "end": 678.52,
          "en": "from the empty to the to be selected page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 678.52,
          "end": 680.28,
          "en": "But instead, at this point of time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 680.28,
          "end": 682.68,
          "en": "it is aware of the page that should be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 682.68,
          "end": 687.12,
          "en": "and it will therefore not make this initial transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 687.12,
          "end": 690.84,
          "en": "So you can then mount your app inside of this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 690.84,
          "end": 695.13,
          "en": "to only mount and therefore render your app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 695.13,
          "end": 699.17,
          "en": "once the router is fully set up and aware of the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 699.17,
          "end": 700.86,
          "en": "that should be loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 700.86,
          "end": 702.88,
          "en": "And if you do that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 702.88,
          "end": 705.01,
          "en": "you don't have this initial animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 705.01,
          "end": 708.16,
          "en": "Now you just have it if you switch routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 708.16,
          "end": 710.84,
          "en": "And now I'm going back to the other animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 710.84,
          "end": 712.4,
          "en": "since that looked nicer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 712.4,
          "end": 715.1,
          "en": "so to the fade button animation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 715.1,
          "end": 716.02,
          "en": "But that is it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 716.02,
          "end": 719.53,
          "en": "That is how you can animate the transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 719.53,
          "end": 721.71,
          "en": "between different routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 721.71,
          "end": 723.93,
          "en": "It's a strange looking syntax maybe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 723.93,
          "end": 727.91,
          "en": "but you really only needed for this transition scenario.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 727.91,
          "end": 731.92,
          "en": "But with that, you're now able to also animate changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 731.92,
          "end": 733.433,
          "en": "between different pages.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
